WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,020
I'll go change my clothes

2
00:00:02,020 --> 00:00:05,830
Hahahaha

3
00:00:05,830 --> 00:00:07,830
The old lady is afraid that I will be bored alone in the courtyard.

4
00:00:07,830 --> 00:00:09,830
I came over specially to cook it

5
00:00:09,830 --> 00:00:12,120
Just to relieve boredom

6
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:15,690
Don't be restrained

7
00:00:15,690 --> 00:00:17,690
Shen Yao has been so busy these days that no one is around

8
00:00:17,690 --> 00:00:19,690
Saying that the errands are heavy

9
00:00:19,690 --> 00:00:20,690
I don’t know if I’m really busy

10
00:00:20,690 --> 00:00:22,690
Or did he deliberately avoid returning home?

11
00:00:22,690 --> 00:00:23,690
It has been raining and snowing for days

12
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:24,690
Everywhere is busy

13
00:00:24,690 --> 00:00:26,690
Even my brother-in-law has announced it in a few days

14
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:27,690
Never returned home

15
00:00:27,690 --> 00:00:29,690
I think it was really official business.

16
00:00:29,690 --> 00:00:30,690
Announce internal tasks

17
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:31,690
If Shen Yan hadn't fallen off his horse and was seriously injured,

18
00:00:31,690 --> 00:00:33,690
How could it be Uncle San's turn to accept it?

19
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:36,140
My husband just doesn’t have this kind of exercise

20
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:38,140
When the prince first announced

21
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:40,140
That's a man who speaks for himself

22
00:00:40,140 --> 00:00:42,140
Young but calm

23
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:43,140
People down there are afraid of him

24
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:45,140
The people above believed him

25
00:00:45,140 --> 00:00:46,140
The errands he handled

26
00:00:46,140 --> 00:00:47,140
Nothing ever went wrong

27
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:49,140
Sister Ji used to live in Beijing when she was young

28
00:00:49,140 --> 00:00:51,140
You should still remember the Ji family’s lawsuit back then, right?

29
00:00:51,140 --> 00:00:52,140
No one dares to answer

30
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:54,140
It was the prince who dealt with the Ji family
